-------------------------------
* AndroidX Activity Compose 1.10.0 — Apache-2.0. Source: https://github.com/androidx/androidx
* AndroidX Compose BOM 2024.12.01, including Compose UI, UI Tooling Preview, and Material 3 — Apache-2.0. Source: https://github.com/androidx/androidx
* MapLibre Android 13.0.2 — BSD-2-Clause. Source: https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native
* Kotlin standard library — Apache-2.0. Source: https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin

